  "body": "Space to enjoy, room to grow and comfort to come home to! This beautifully designed, brand-new single-level home in Strathmill, Orewa, combines high ceilings, a designer kitchen and a warm, welcoming atmosphere. Large living room windows frame the private garden, while sliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom open onto a sunny deck. With a generous, flat backyard, extra parking and thoughtful modern features, this is a home designed for easy family living and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nFeatures You Will Love:\r\n\r\n•  3 spacious bedrooms and 2 stylish bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n•  High ceilings creating a bright, airy and spacious feel\r\n•  Large living room windows overlooking the private garden\r\n•  Sliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom opening directly onto the sunny deck\r\n•  Designer kitchen with quality appliances, gas cooking and stylish finishes\r\n•  Beautifully designed bathrooms, both with windows for natural light and ventilation\r\n•  Sun tunnel in the hallway bringing in additional natural light\r\n•  Ambient ceiling lighting adding a modern, elegant touch\r\n•  Generous, flat and fully fenced backyard with room for a trampoline, kids to play and outdoor entertaining\r\n•  Easy-care section offering more time to enjoy life and less time on maintenance\r\n•  Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n•  Single internal-access garage plus two off-street parking spaces\r\n•  Pre-wiring for future EV charger installation\r\n•  Brick and weatherboard cladding with modern street appeal\r\n•  10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n•  Handy to Orewa Beach, schools, shops and cafés\r\n\r\nOne Community. Multiple Homes. One Easy Tour!\r\n\r\nWhy visit one home when you can explore several?\r\n\r\nWe have a great selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, offering different layouts, sizes and features to suit your lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nCall Brianna and Brian to book your personalised Strathmill Home Tour – compare multiple homes in one convenient visit!\r\n\r\nViewing Directions: Via Flavell Road, or GPS to 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa. Follow the Strathmill signs.",
